### Platform admin: sign in first with http/auth.http as the Platform admin account (login answers redirectTo "/platform") and paste the token.
### List every organization (Platform admin only)
# Expect 200 {"items":[{"id","name","slug","status","plan","currentPeriodEnd","createdAt"}],"total","page","pageSize"}.
# Newest first. status is the stored value (TRIAL stays TRIAL; the screen shows it as "Aktif"). plan and currentPeriodEnd are null without a subscription. No stock data.
GET http://localhost:3000/api/platform/organizations?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unknown query key or pageSize above 100: 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
GET http://localhost:3000/api/platform/organizations?pageSize=101
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Owner, Warehouse Admin or Viewer token: 403 FORBIDDEN (before the query is looked at)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/platform/organizations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### No token: 401 UNAUTHENTICATED
GET http://localhost:3000/api/platform/organizations
